msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Do you sell clothing? "
msgctxt "bark 0412:34C3"
msgid "I sell those that I make. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am interested in gems. "
msgctxt "bark 0412:3589"
